# GN4 Guile Webservice Documentation

This is the documentation for setting up the `gn-guile` webservice locally.

## 1. Channels Setup

Building the profile with a  channel file.



```

;; guile_channels.scm
(list
 (channel
  (name 'gn-machines)
  (url "https://git.genenetwork.org/gn-machines")
  (branch "main")))


```

## 2. Clone Repositories

### gn-guile
> git clone tux02.genenetwork.org:/home/git/public/gn-guile  
or  
> git clone https://git.genenetwork.org/gn-guile

### gn-docs
> git clone https://git.genenetwork.org/gn-docs/ ~/gn-guile-files/gn-docs

> Ensure `gn-docs-local-checkout` points to this path.

## 3. Running the Web Server

Navigate to `gn-guile` and start the server:

> guix shell --container --network --file=guix.scm -- guile -L . --fresh-auto-compile -e main bin/gn-guile 8091

- `--container` runs in an isolated environment  
- `--network` allows container network access  

Check API root:  
> curl http://127.0.0.1:8091

Other endpoints:  
> curl http://127.0.0.1:8091/home/msk  
> curl http://127.0.0.1:8091/home/aging

### 3.1 Development with Emacs/Geiser

> guix shell --container --network --development --file=guix.scm -- guile -L . --fresh-auto-compile --listen=1970 -e main bin/gn-guile 8091  --gn-docs-local-checkout /home/kabui/gn-guile-files/gn-docs

- Connect via **Emacs-Geiser** on port `1970`  
- Update procedures live using `C-M-x`  
- Alternatives: [ares](https://git.sr.ht/~abcdw/guile-ares-rs) and [arei](https://git.sr.ht/~abcdw/emacs-arei)

## 4. Configuration Notes

`gn-docs-local-checkout` must exist:

> mkdir -p ~/gn-guile-files/gn-docs

Or pass it explicitly:

> guile -e main bin/gn-guile --gn-docs-local-checkout /home/kabui/gn-guile-files/gn-docs

Inside `--container`, bind with:

> --share=$HOME/gn-guile-files=/home/kabui/gn-guile-files

 guix shell --container --network --development --file=guix.scm  --share=/home/kabui/gn-guile-files=/home/kabui/gn-guile-files -- guile -L . --fresh-auto-compile --listen=1970 -e main bin/gn-guile --gn-docs-local-checkout "/home/kabui/gn-guile-files/gn-docs 
